  "details": "i would like to be able to make features that relate to other features but in order to do that it is required that you have VRC+ or for example doing a \"drone shot\" of a world for something such as a promotional thing from the build & test OR test out features before considering to get VRC+ as a developer\n\nsee: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/drone-issue-in-local-test\n\ngetting banned for using a VRC+ feature sucks and i would rather be able to test these features on my own in a build & test as i dont wanna take a alt used for world development and give it VRC+ just to waste my money more on greedy features like the drone for world creation just for it to also get banned for using a built-in feature.",
